---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="1st North American Chinese AI Music Creative Competition 2026–2027 Officially Launches!" description="Celebrating ZJU's 130th and ZJUAA NC's 15th anniversaries, this event is co-organized by NACUAA chapters and AI clubs. Registration is now open!" path="/en/posts/2026-07-22-first-north-american-chinese-ai-music-competition/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/posts/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to news</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">
          <time datetime="2026-07-22">July 22, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>Event Announcement</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          1st North American Chinese AI Music Creative Competition 2026–2027 Launches!
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-4 flex items-center gap-x-2">
          <span>Hosts: NACUAA chapters, ZJUAA NC, and AI clubs</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="font-semibold text-white">
          To celebrate the 130th anniversary of Zhejiang University and the 15th anniversary of ZJUAA NC, this competition is jointly organized by the Zhejiang University Alumni Association of North Carolina (ZJUAA NC), sister alumni associations, and NACUAA chapters.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-blue-950/40 border border-blue-900/30 rounded-2xl p-5 my-6 text-slate-300 space-y-3 shadow-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-x-2 text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
            <span>Official Website is Now Live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Registration has officially opened! For complete rules, lists of judges, submission guidelines, and event announcements, please visit the official website:
          </p>
          <div class="text-xs space-y-2 pt-1 border-t border-slate-900">
            <p>
              🔗 <strong>Official Website</strong>:
              <a href="https://chinesemusic.ai" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold transition-colors">
                https://chinesemusic.ai
              </a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">Mission & Purpose</h3>
        <p>
          To celebrate the 130th anniversary of Zhejiang University and the 15th anniversary of ZJUAA NC, this competition is jointly organized by the Zhejiang University Alumni Association of North Carolina (ZJUAA NC), and sister alumni associations in the US East (Tennessee, Philadelphia, Rhode Island, Florida, etc.), along with NACUAA chapters (North Carolina, South Carolina, Northern California, Silicon Valley, Southern California) and the AI Entrepreneurship Club.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">Creative Categories (8 Directions)</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Poetry Writing</strong>: Classical poetry or modern verses.</li>
          <li><strong>Lyrics Writing</strong>: Expressive and narrative songwriting.</li>
          <li><strong>Composition</strong>: Melodic compositions and charts.</li>
          <li><strong>Arranging</strong>: Digital and acoustic instrumentation.</li>
          <li><strong>Vocals</strong>: Live or AI-blended vocal performances.</li>
          <li><strong>A Cappella</strong>: Multi-part vocal arrangements.</li>
          <li><strong>Instrumental</strong>: Solos, ensembles, or synthesized music.</li>
          <li><strong>Music Video / MV</strong>: Thematic music videos and cinematic graphics.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">Important Timeline</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Registration Deadline</strong>: August 28, 2026 (Midnight EDT)</li>
          <li><strong>Preliminary Selection</strong>: Sept 26–28, 2026 (Auditions)</li>
          <li><strong>University Showcase</strong>: Sept 30, 2026 (Nomination to ZJU celebration)</li>
          <li><strong>Alliance Semifinals</strong>: Dec 12, 2026 (East vs. West showdown)</li>
          <li><strong>Grand Finals</strong>: Feb 27, 2027</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">Sponsorships & Contact</h3>
        <p>
          We welcome sponsors, co-hosts, and supporters! All sponsorship funds are tax-deductible under 501(c)(3) guidelines through VI AI Foundation / ZJUAA NC.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>WeChat</strong>: zjuaanc</li>
          <li><strong>Email</strong>: music@zjuaanc.org</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Scan to Register via WeChat</strong>:<br/>
            <img src="/images/wechat_match_registration_qr.jpg" alt="WeChat QR Code for Registration" class="w-36 h-36 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-lg object-cover mt-2" />
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
